    "rationale": "Present risk is dominated by a property finding: production deploy and irreversible migration actions are executed with the engineer's delegated credentials, while the only instruction-and-reason record is user-deletable chat history and the cloud audit log attributes actions to the human rather than the agent. Under rubric section 5a, the affected capabilities include S3 consequential actions, so inherent is high and remains high because no declared control restores attributable provenance. Manual validation applied because scripts could not be run in this environment."
